          "When a monetary amount is expressed in a currency whose sub\u2011unit exponent is zero (e.g., JPY), the value presented by the API must contain no fractional component.",
          "The representation of such a rounded amount must not include a decimal point or trailing zeros (e.g., \"1200\" instead of \"1200.00\")."
