          "For all other monetary amounts (those with no fractional cent or with fractional cents other than 0.5\u202f\u00a2), the invoice total must be the quoted amount rounded according to the system\u2019s standard rounding policy (which is assumed to be correct for those cases).",
          "The invoice total must never be less than the quoted amount."
        ],
        "inputs": [
          "A quoted amount expressed in dollars (or cents) that includes a half\u2011cent fraction, e.g., $1.025, $10.005, $0.005.",
          "A quoted amount that does not include a half\u2011cent fraction, e.g., $1.00, $2.34, $5.67."
        ],
        "expected_outputs": [
